# DEV/CI-only mock ERRU hub (unauthenticated by design, see
# DSL/Ruuter/ljvis/POST/v1/erru/mock/.guard) must never ship in the deployed image.
# Excluding it from the build context means it cannot end up in any image built from
# this repo, regardless of which Dockerfile COPYs DSL/Ruuter/ljvis. Local/CI
# docker-compose files bind-mount the full DSL/Ruuter/ljvis tree from the host, which
# restores the mock endpoints for those environments only (bind mounts are unaffected
# by .dockerignore).
DSL/Ruuter/ljvis/POST/v1/erru/mock
